🚀 URL Shortener — Django

A production-oriented Django URL Shortener application for creating, managing, tracking, and administering shortened URLs. The project includes user authentication, a personal dashboard, AJAX-based URL management, click analytics, device/browser detection, click-history management, and a customized Django administration interface.

Project: URL Shortener
Backend: Django / Python
Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Bootstrap 5
Database: SQLite by default, PostgreSQL supported
Static files: WhiteNoise
Deployment: Gunicorn / Heroku-compatible configuration
Repository: https://github.com/vishnuvm1122/url-shortner

