🔎 Project Overview

The URL Shortener converts long URLs into compact URLs that are easier to share.

Example:

Original:
https://example.com/products/category/security/product?id=12345

Short:
https://your-domain.com/aB12x9

When a visitor opens the short URL, the application:

Finds the matching URL record.

Verifies that the URL is active.

Atomically increments the click counter.

Collects the visitor's IP address.

Parses the browser/device user-agent.

Stores click metadata.

Redirects the visitor to the original URL.

The application is designed around two major areas:

User side: registration, login, profile, URL creation, URL management and analytics.

Administrator side: centralized management of URLs and click records.

