🧹 Backup and Maintenance

SQLite backup

For development:

cp db.sqlite3 db.sqlite3.backup

For production PostgreSQL:

pg_dump "$DATABASE_URL" > backup.sql

Restore:

psql "$DATABASE_URL" < backup.sql

Always test backups by performing periodic restore exercises.

