        ▼
     Admin Panel
        │
        ├─ URLs
        ├─ Clicks
        ├─ Search
        ├─ Filters
        └─ Management

The current implementation is well suited for learning, internal deployments, prototypes, and as a foundation for a more advanced SaaS-grade URL-shortening platform. For public production use, prioritize security hardening, abuse prevention, rate limiting, privacy controls, PostgreSQL, monitoring, and scalable analytics.
